  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat and sauté onions until translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in berbere, tomato paste, and cook until fragrant, about 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth and water, bring to a simmer.",
    "Slice morcilla into rounds and add to pot.",
    "Add fermented kimchi and simmer for 10 minutes to meld flavors.",
    "Season with salt and pepper.",
    "Reduce heat and let stew thicken for another 5 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Serve hot over quinoa or injera."
